<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://l1351868270.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://l1351868270.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-03-05T12:28:35+00:00</updated><id>https://l1351868270.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">Shuliang Li</title><subtitle>A simple, whitespace theme for academics. Based on [*folio](https://github.com/bogoli/-folio) design. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">策略梯度算法汇总</title><link href="https://l1351868270.github.io/blog/2026/po-2/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="策略梯度算法汇总"/><published>2026-03-04T21:15:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-03-04T21:15:00+00:00</updated><id>https://l1351868270.github.io/blog/2026/po-2</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://l1351868270.github.io/blog/2026/po-2/"><![CDATA[<h2 id="gspo-">GSPO <d-cite key="group-sequence-policy-optimization"></d-cite></h2> \[\begin{aligned} \mathcal{J}_{GSPO} \left( \theta \right) &amp;= \mathbb{E}_{x \sim \mathcal{D}, \{y_{i}\}_{i=1}^{G} \sim \pi_{\theta_{old}} \left( \cdot | x \right)} \\ &amp;= \left[ \frac{1}{G} \sum_{i=1}^{G} \text{min} \left( s_{i}\left( \theta \right) \hat{A_{i}}, \text{clip} \left(s_{i}\left( \theta \right), 1-\epsilon, 1 + \epsilon \right)\hat{A_{i}} \right) \right] \end{aligned}\]]]></content><author><name>Shuliang Li</name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[强化学习笔记]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">lora 1: 初识lora</title><link href="https://l1351868270.github.io/blog/2026/lora-1/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="lora 1: 初识lora"/><published>2026-02-03T21:15:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-02-03T21:15:00+00:00</updated><id>https://l1351868270.github.io/blog/2026/lora-1</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://l1351868270.github.io/blog/2026/lora-1/"><![CDATA[<h2 id="基本概念">基本概念</h2> <h3 id="基本公式">基本公式</h3> \[W = W_{0} + AB, \qquad A \in \mathbb{R}^{d_{in} \times r}, B \in \mathbb{R}^{r \times d_{out}}\]]]></content><author><name>Shuliang Li</name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[lora学习笔记]]></summary></entry></feed>